CSV 7.5 build: 9639 released: 2016-05-21 compiled with: Java 1.8.0_131 Jet jet12.0-pro-x86/1.8.0_131

Read, write, align, condense, dump, sort, convert, patch, reshape, group pack... CSV (Comma, tab and semicolon-Separated Variable) files.

